 "description": "Estimate a player's new Elo rating after a single game with the Elo formula. Pure arithmetic, no chess engine. The system field picks a K-factor default for FIDE, Chess.com or Lichess, but the result is an Elo estimate: Chess.com and Lichess use Glicko ratings, so their real rating changes differ.",
